// What the model gives, written by `BLESS=1` (design/19-cases.md).
run: every order
outcome 1
  refused
  value 1: u16
  value ?k: !
  value None: Option<!>
  value `Option⟨u16⟩`: Option<u16>
  value `Option⟨u8⟩`: Option<u8>
